{"title":"Frobenius automorphism","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>For a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Finite_field\" title=\"Finite field\">finite field</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Characteristic\" title=\"Characteristic\">characteristic</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, the <b> Frobenius automorphism </b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is a field <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Automorphism\" title=\"Automorphism\">automorphism</a> defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/64052920c0f8492868fcd22fbebec441f7edc95d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F(a) = a^p\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b03953fe0c4372dcfeef18d8b703f79b5cb0eb24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>The Frobenius automorphism is a case of the <b>Frobenius endomorphism</b> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Commutative_ring\" title=\"Commutative ring\">commutative rings</a>.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Frobenius_automorphism&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018033243\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 22/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 307/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 850/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.065      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    7.065      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:22562:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018033243 and revision id 172319. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}